\n  select(model, r.squared, adj.r.squared, sigma, AIC, BIC, p.value)\n\nmodel_comparison\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n# A tibble: 3 × 7\n  model   r.squared adj.r.squared sigma    AIC    BIC  p.value\n  <chr>       <dbl>         <dbl> <dbl>  <dbl>  <dbl>    <dbl>\n1 Model 1    0.0298        0.0284  20.1 12269. 12290. 7.94e-10\n2 Model 2    0.0119        0.0112  20.2 12292. 12308. 4.76e- 5\n3 Model 3    0.0227        0.0220  20.1 12277. 12293. 1.66e- 8\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n",
